OL,3,ABritish hacker who stole $11m through  
OL,4,Atext message scheme jailed for six     
OL,5,Ayears in US                            
OL,7,FA British hacker has been sentenced to 
OL,8,Fsix years in a federal prison in the US
OL,9,Ffor conspiring to hack into at least a 
OL,10,Fdozen companies via text message       
OL,11,Fphishing, and stealing more than $11.6m
OL,12,F(#8.8m) in cryptocurrency from         
OL,13,Findividual victims.                    
OL,15,FTyler Buchanan, 24, from Dundee,       
OL,16,Fstarted hacking as a teenager and was  
OL,17,Fpart of the collective of young hackers
OL,18,Fknown as Scattered Spider, which has   
OL,19,Fbeen blamed for a string of high       
OL,20,Fprofile cyber-crimes.                  
